§ `s 251(f) and (g) -- mergers that need no vote of the stockholders`

§§ `s 251(f) the surviving constituent corporation, and a corporation that has issued no stock`

-- One field per fact (f)(1) to (f)(3) turns on. Limb (3) is a disjunction: either nothing is issued or delivered, or what is
-- issued or delivered plus what is issuable on conversion does not exceed 20% of the common stock outstanding.
-- src:1080 | unless required by its certificate of incorporation, no vote of stockholders of a constituent corporation surviving a merger shall be necessary to authorize a merger if (1) the agreement of merger does not amend in any respect the certificate of incorporation of such constituent corporation, (2) each share of stock of such constituent corporation outstanding immediately prior to the effective date of the merger is to be an identical outstanding or treasury share of the surviving corporation after the effective date of the merger, and (3) either no shares of common stock of the surviving corporation and no shares, securities or obligations convertible into such stock are to be issued or delivered under the plan of merger, or the authorized unissued shares or the treasury shares of common stock of the surviving corporation to be issued or delivered under the plan of merger plus those initially issuable upon conversion of any other shares, securities or obligations to be issued or delivered under such plan do not exceed 20% of the shares of common stock of such constituent corporation outstanding immediately prior to the effective date of the merger. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 251(f) (src:1080)
DECLARE `s 251(f) Terms of the merger` HAS
    `the agreement of merger amends the certificate of incorporation of the constituent corporation in some respect` IS A BOOLEAN
    `each outstanding share of the constituent corporation is to be an identical outstanding or treasury share of the surviving corporation` IS A BOOLEAN
    `no shares of common stock of the surviving corporation, and no shares, securities or obligations convertible into such stock, are to be issued or delivered under the plan of merger` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the number of authorized unissued or treasury shares of common stock of the surviving corporation to be issued or delivered under the plan of merger` IS A NUMBER
    `the number of shares of common stock initially issuable upon conversion of any other shares, securities or obligations to be issued or delivered under the plan` IS A NUMBER
    `the number of shares of common stock of the constituent corporation outstanding immediately before the effective date` IS A NUMBER

-- "do not exceed 20%": 20% itself is within the limit.
