    AND terms's `each outstanding share of the constituent corporation is to be an identical outstanding or treasury share of the surviving corporation`
    AND `s 251(f)(3) the issue of common stock is within the limit` terms

-- Second sentence: no stockholder vote for a merger or consolidation if no shares of the corporation's stock had been issued
-- when the board adopted the resolution. The "unless required by its certificate" of the first sentence is not repeated
-- here (NOTES.md fork register F9).
