-- "holding company" (src:1090), "as used in this subsection only": a corporation that, from its incorporation until the
-- merger is consummated, was at all times a direct or indirect wholly-owned subsidiary of the constituent corporation,
-- and whose capital stock is issued in the merger.
-- src:1090 | As used in this subsection only, the term “holding company” means a corporation which, from its incorporation until consummation of a merger governed by this subsection, was at all times a direct or indirect wholly-owned subsidiary of the constituent corporation and whose capital stock is issued in such merger. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 251(g) (src:1090)
