        (CONSIDER entity's `kind of entity`
         WHEN `a corporation` k THEN TRUE
         OTHERWISE FALSE)
    AND `from its incorporation until the merger is consummated it was at all times a direct or indirect wholly-owned subsidiary of the constituent corporation`
