    `the holding company`                  IS AN Entity
    `the constituent corporation`          IS AN Entity
    `the other constituent entity`         IS AN Entity
    `the certificate of incorporation and bylaws of the holding company immediately after the effective time contain provisions identical to those of the constituent corporation immediately before it, other than the excepted provisions` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the constituent corporation or its successor becomes or remains a direct or indirect wholly-owned subsidiary of the holding company` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the directors of the constituent corporation become or remain the directors of the holding company` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the surviving entity`                 IS AN Entity
    `the organizational documents of the surviving entity require the approval of the stockholders of the holding company, in addition, of acts and transactions that would have required the approval of the stockholders of the constituent corporation` IS A BOOLEAN
