              WHEN `a corporation` k THEN TRUE
              OTHERWISE FALSE)
          OR (    terms's `the organizational documents of the surviving entity require the approval of the stockholders of the holding company, in addition, of an amendment that a corporation would be required to include in its certificate of incorporation`
              AND terms's `the organizational documents of the surviving entity provide that its business and affairs are managed by or under the direction of a board or other governing body of individuals subject to the same fiduciary duties as directors of a corporation`))

